hadiths[16]{hadithnumber,text}:
"863","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Umrah se Umrah tak unkey darmiyaan (gunaahon) ka kaffaara hai. Aur Hajj-e-Mabroor ka badla Jannat key siwa nahi hai. (Bukhari: 1773)"
"864","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se Hajj se pehley Umrah key baarey mein poochha gaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Koi harj nahi. Aur kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hajj karney se pehley Umrah kya. (Bukhari: 1774)"
"865","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke un se kaha gaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kitney Umrah kiye? Unhon-ne kaha: Chaar, un mein aik Rajab mein. Poochhney waley ne kaha: To main ne Aisha se kaha: Ae ammi! Kya tum nahi sunteen jo Abu Abdur Rahman kehtey hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kya kehtey hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chaar Umrah kiye, un mein aik Rajab mein. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah Abu Abdur Rahman par rehem farmaaey. Aap ne koi Umrah nahi kya magar wo us mein haazir they. Aur Aap ne Rajab mein kabhi Umrah nahi kya. (Bukhari: 1776)"
"866","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se poochha gaya: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kitney Umrah kiye? Unhon-ne kaha: Chaar: Hudaibiya ka Umrah Zul Qaada mein jahaan mushrikeen ne Aap ko roka. Aur aaney waley saal ka Umrah Zul Qaada mein jahaan Aap ne un se sulah ki. Aur Jiraana ka Umrah jab Aap ne ganeemat taqseem ki, mera khayaal hai Hunain ki. Main ne kaha: Aap ne kitney Hajj kiye? Unhon-ne kaha: Aik. (Bukhari: 1778)"
"867","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umrah kya jahaan unhon-ne Aap ko wapas kya aur aaney waley saal Hudaibiya ka Umrah aur Zul Qaada mein Umrah aur apne Hajj key sath Umrah. (Bukhari: 1779)"
"868","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zul Qaada mein Hajj karney se pehley do martaba Umrah kya. (Bukhari: 1781)"
"869","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey hukm diya ke wo Aisha ko sawaar karey aur unhey Taneem se Umrah karaaey. Aur Suraaqa bin Maalik bin Joasham (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Aqaba mein milay jabke Aap use rami kar rahey they. To us ne kaha: Kya ye tumharey liye khaas hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, balke hamesha key liye hai. (Bukhari: 1784, 1785)"
"870","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) ki Hajj mein hadees bahut martaba dohraai gai hai aur wo poori guzar chuki hai. Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai ke Nabi ne un se Umrah mein farmaya: Lekin wo tumharey kharch ya tumhaari mehnat key qadr par hai. (Bukhari: 1787)"
"871","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) ki Hajj mein hadees bahut martaba dohraai gai hai aur wo poori guzar chuki hai. Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai ke Nabi ne un se Umrah mein farmaya: Lekin wo tumharey kharch ya tumhaari mehnat key qadr par hai. (Bukhari: 1787)"
"872","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abi Bakr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo jab bhi Hajoon se guzartein to kehtin: Allah apne Rasool Muhammad par rehmat bhejey. Beshak ham uskey sath yahaan utrey they jabke ham us din halkay they, hamaari sawaariyaan kam thein, hamaara tosha kam tha. To main ne aur meri behan Aisha aur Zubair aur fulaan aur fulaan ne Umrah kya. Phir jab ham ne Bait ka masaah kya to halaal ho gaey, phir ham ne shaam ko Hajj ka ehraam baandha. (Bukhari: 1796)"
"873","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab ghazwe ya Hajj ya Umrah se wapas aatey to zameen key har buland hissey par teen takbeerein kehtey, phir farmatey: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, Akela, uska koi shareek nahi. Uskey liye baadshahat hai aur uskey liye hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qaadir hai. Wapas aaney waley, tauba karney waley, ibaadat karney waley, sajda karney waley, apne Rab ki hamd karney waley. Allah ne apna waada sach kya aur apne bandey ki madad ki aur girohon ko Akeley ne shikast di. (Bukhari: 1797)"
"874","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makkah tashreef laaey to Bani Abdul Muttalib key chhotey bachchey Aap key isteqbaal key liye aey. To Aap ne aik ko apne saamney sawaar kya aur doosrey ko peechey. (Bukhari: 1798)"
"875","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ko apne ghar walon key paas na aatey they. Aap subah ya shaam key siwa daakhil na hotey they. (Bukhari: 1800)"
"876","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke wo raat ko apne ghar walon key paas aaey. (Bukhari: 1801)"
"877","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar se tashreef laatey aur Madina key teelon ko dekhtey to apni oontni daudaaetay. Aur agar sawaari hoti to use harkat detey. Aur aik riwayat mein izaafa hai: Uski mohabbat se. (Bukhari: 1802)"
"878","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Safar azaab ka tukda hai jo tum mein se kisi ko uska khaana aur uska peena aur uski neend rokta hai. Phir jab wo apni haajat poori kar ley to apne ghar walon ki taraf jaldi aaey. (Bukhari: 1804). Ghira jaaney waley ki kitaab."
